            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Hariharan Rangasamy",
                        "email": "hariharanr@ami.com",
                        "username": "hariharanrangasamy"
                    },
                    "message": "I tested the changes and the virtual media file selection works. Go to Operations -> Virtual Media -> Add File. After choosing a file, the Start button appears. Clicking Start begins the media redirection."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Tan Siewert",
                        "email": "tan@siewert.io",
                        "username": "sinuscosinustan"
                    },
                    "message": "Tested as requested and can confirm that the firmware update works again."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "I checked and see that it is working fine, But without this change also, the code works fine? @jwestover@nvidia.com\nWhere can we see the difference in functionality before and after? Curious to know."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Tan Siewert",
                        "email": "tan@siewert.io",
                        "username": "sinuscosinustan"
                    },
                    "message": "With the Bootstrap 5 migration the firmware payload for example was no longer the file but `[object Event]`. See [1].\n\n[1] https://discord.com/channels/775381525260664832/776550056391606352/1448378851473227959\n\nIf you do not have Discord:\n```\nCommit d36ac8a (\"Migrate to Bootstrap 5 and remove Vue compat plugin\") introduced a bug in the multipart firmware upload that causes the UpdateFile to be [object Event]. Tbh, I am not sure what exactly broke it. Maybe someone has an idea what could cause this?\n\nBefore commit:\n------geckoformboundaryd3d488b7cbaf406536716f2a7b41455\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"UpdateFile\"; filename=\"obmc-phosphor-image-platform.static.mtd.tar\"\nContent-Type: application/x-tar\n\nimage-u-boot [..]\n\n\nAfter commit:\n------geckoformboundaryb91001c7ac3eb51cf2be0c86685d134c\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"UpdateFile\"\n\n[object Event]\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Westover",
                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "In most of these components, 1-way binding was kind of working, but there were a lot of bugs.  For instance, in the add-user dialog, the Role dropdown had to be selected twice for the form to update properly.  \n\nThis PR also replaced https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/webui-vue/+/85608 which is the file input issue on the VM page (I also reproduced this on the fw update page, as did others as noted in the Discord channel).  \n\nI followed https://v3-migration.vuejs.org/breaking-changes/v-model and updated all instances I found - and tested them to ensure they now work."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "Okay, Thanks!"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "Resolving."
                }
            ],
